            "review_title": "Review at Vivins Wine Club",
            "review_text": "Uyen nguyen\n9 contributions\n0\nMy favorite location for me & my close friends\nNov 2018 • Friends\nA really wonderful place for close friends to chat after high pressures days of works. We did enjoy good wines, delicious beef and special breads imported from French directly. Coming to this restaurant, we can feel not only the warm atmosphere with talent musicians, professional waiters and waitresses, but also the thoughtfulness of gentle restaurant’s owner. Thank you so much, ViVins!\nRead more\nWritten November 11, 2018",
